        "id": "ch8_3_1-2",
        "text": "There are several built-in action functions available with Apache Spark. The commonly\nused action functions are as follows:\n\u2022 count : The count action returns the number of elements in an RDD.\n\u2022 collect : This action returns the entire RDD to the driver program.\n\u2022 reduce : This action will reduce the elements from an RDD. A simple example is an\naddition operation on an RDD dataset.\nIntroducing RDDs      287\nFor a complete list of transformation and action functions, we suggest you check the\nofficial documentation of Apache Spark. Next, we will study how to create RDDs.",
